Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.14 25/59] bnx2x: Remove configured vlans as part of unload sequence.
Date:   Wed, 26 Dec 2018 17:38:05 -0500
Message-Id: <20181226223839.150262-25-sashal@kernel.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.19.1
